9970779419,"text_excerpt":"Wow 9.95 for buffet stewed chicken, hamburger steak, bbq chicken legs and thighs. Mixed vegetables, corn, broccoli, mash taters and two types of rice. The salad bar was amazing tons of choices and super fresh. People need to start coming in here because its definitley a hidden local gem. Id like to save the last comment for the best item on this quaint but filling buffet. He has fried catfish with some fries on the bar let me tell you something thick fish not BATTER! FISH! The batter was amazing and the fish was so good ive never seen any other place in the area with fish as good as his. Dont just pass by you should definitely give it a try."},{"business_id":"B6oUNsRtdoHpBccvbFrDAQ","review_id":"yzMqmRcJbDuCPunkwkCmbA","date":"2018-08-25T21:50:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8935848474502563,"text_excerpt":"Customer service was top notch. Very curious and attentive. Server was the best part of the visit. Food was 9 out of 10. Delicious with a large variety. The JPSO thru me off with the home town special treatment they received over me...but I'm simply a visitor. I recommend."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"B6oUNsRtdoHpBccvbFrDAQ","photo_id":"puWFyafBZSP40b6ymKTQtQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/puWFyafBZSP40b6ymKTQtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8625805974006653},{"business_id":"B6oUNsRtdoHpBccvbFrDAQ","photo_id":"Lg-TNbriMhZVTphrvybEGQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Lg-TNbriMhZVTphrvybEGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8585629463195801},{"business_id":"B6oUNsRtdoHpBccvbFrDAQ","photo_id":"uOk5-kqeUatUlvvoI8yqDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uOk5-kqeUatUlvvoI8yqDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8585629463195801},{"business_id":"B6oUNsRtdoHpBccvbFrDAQ","photo_id":"2LAlQInqww3VGR5k25PK7g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2LAlQInqww3VGR5k25PK7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.846001386642456},{"business_id":"B6oUNsRtdoHpBccvbFrDAQ","photo_id":"8yBC37qcFhEeOIR8qvf0Yw","label":"inside","image_url"